# Full shutdown ordering with everything alive. Visible order (see the log / ev lines):
# hotkey thread stopped and hotkey state freed -> context data freed (log "Freeing OBS context data":
# main canvas, outputs, encoders, displays, services, public sources, all sources, public canvases,
# remaining canvases; each non-empty group logs "N <kind>(s) were remaining") -> audio freed
# -> video mixes freed (log of leftover views) -> hotkey strings / name map / platform freed ->
# graphics device destroyed -> core pointer cleared.
startup en-US -
reset_video fmt=BGRA gpu=0
reset_audio
canvas_create c1 Alpha video=1 base=64x64 out=64x64 fmt=BGRA gpu=0
view_create v
view_add v
mk_output o1 Out1
mk_encoder e1 Enc1
mk_service s1 Svc1
mk_source i1 In1
mk_source p1 Priv private=1
display_create d1 10 10 0
sig_obs canvas_destroy
trace sub on
trace gs on
shutdown
